{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nr=json.load(open('/tmp/r001-runtime.json')); context=r['context']; source=Path('candidate.py').read_text();import ast\nconfig=ast.literal_eval(next(x.value for x in ast.parse(source).body if isinstance(x,ast.Assign) and any(isinstance(t,ast.Name) and t.id=='CONFIG' for t in x.targets)))\ncommon=['Frozen protocol '+r['required_study_protocol_ref'],'scratch single-pass training, seed 20262027, batch 8192, all samples and four labels','g0 joint pair-content/count backbone and g2 8-bin membership','content-only residual moments, raw exposure counts, 296-wide input and 64-hidden readout','all modules, initialization order, zero output initialization, pooling and task heads','identical rate/background/shrinkage computations in all three new arms']\ncontrasts=[]\ndef contrast(intervention,control,confounds,support,no):\n return dict(parent_ref='g2-r0019-content_rates',intervention=intervention,control=control,held_fixed=common,remaining_confounds=confounds,decision_if_supported=support,decision_if_not_supported=no)\ncontrasts.append(contrast('exposure_rates: replace raw slot fractions by n/(n+4)*local + 4/(n+4)*visible-user background; zero empty slots','Archived g2-r0019-content_rates, raw fractions; preserve raw mode for a host equivalence check',['Raw versus shrunk inputs differ in scale, finite-precision rounding and information encoding; this is not a capacity intervention.','Single-seed selection among many historical trials; source gain over g0 is only 0.00010475117174046922.'],'If the replacement improves validation macro AUC over raw and both source bests, retain as preliminary utility; inspect every task and cost, then repeat.','Retain the raw incumbent; a null result limits this shrinkage placement, not all reliability models.'))\ncontrasts.append(contrast('diversity_rates: same separate-rate shrinkage but support is slot-local n\"'^2/sum(ad-frequency''^2)'\"','exposure_rates: support n; both compute the same ID histogram and every other operation',['Ad repetition is not a verified correlation model; unknown/colliding IDs and task-mask dependence remain.','Different support changes rate scale; this alone cannot establish variance reduction.'],'Require a paired advantage over exposure_rates, raw rates and background_rates before attributing added utility to diversity support; repeat the decisive contrast.','Do not claim diversity transfer; preserve the previous near-null joint-diversity versus joint-exposure outcome.'))\ncontrasts.append(contrast('Best local-shrinkage arm: occupied-bin local rates mixed with background','background_rates: same visible-user background repeated only across occupied slots; same projection/readout/nominal parameter count',['Background repetition reduces effective feature rank although nominal capacity and modules match.','All g0 paths retain historical feedback; this removes only local feedback from the appended rate block.'],'If local-shrinkage beats background and raw, local rate information with this regularization has preliminary utility; causal noise-reduction mechanism remains unconfirmed.','If background matches or wins, favor simpler encoding and reject a local-feedback reliability claim; broad feedback modeling is not refuted.'))\nstudy=dict(id='g2-t002-separate-rate-reliability',protocol_ref=r['required_study_protocol_ref'],evidence_refs=context['allowed_observation_ids'],question='Does moving the committed g2 reliability shrinkage into the separate feedback-rate inputs of the stronger g0/content-only residual improve validation macro AUC beyond the raw-rate incumbent, and does ad-diversity support add value over exposure support and user-background rates?',hypothesis='Observed: g2-r0019-content_rates macro AUC 0.8315142702328122 exceeds g0-r0013-pair_joint_both 0.8314095190610717 by only 0.00010475117174046922, with worse macro Logloss by 0.000007826838391421231 and favorite AUC lower by 0.00001732018301237037. Its rate-versus-count contrast is +0.00011556254814149014. Source inspection shows content replacement discards the shrunk centered-product moments, leaving raw feedback fractions; support_mode therefore has no active effect on these rate inputs. Sparse local rates may still benefit from reliability shrinkage without multiplying the content representation. The inherited visible-user background includes the slot and is not an independent prior. Diversity is an unverified proxy for dependence, not a statistical effective sample size guarantee. All observations are single-seed and mechanism support is provisional.',nearest_work=[dict(source_ref='paper:din',verification='read',difference='Archived primary section4.3 lines250-277 inspected: target-conditioned unnormalized history pooling is inherited unchanged. Separate masked feedback-rate shrinkage is a local extension, with no DIN reproduction or novelty claim.'),dict(source_ref='unirank-code:HiFormer',verification='implementation_checked',difference='Pinned benchmark forward lines113-159 inspected: attention pooling, field tokenization and interaction precede task readout. This study retains an existing unified stack and changes only its appended rate inputs; it is not an original HiFormer reproduction. Original paper:hiformer detail remains unavailable in the authorized archive and priority is unverified.'),dict(source_ref='trial://g2-r0016-diversity_factorized',verification='implementation_checked',difference='Committed standalone module inspected; reuse its eight disjoint bins, ad-frequency diversity and strength4 interpolation, but apply interpolation to the separate four-rate block rather than multiplying projected content.'),dict(source_ref='trial://g2-r0019-content_rates',verification='implementation_checked',difference='Exact source hash 1ec68734ad73ccf5df47b8f7d6e2c55a24b12e228e1f5e0a910b55077b531795 verified. Keep every module and content feature; replace only the 8x4 raw rate values with a same-width rate encoding.')],inherited_components=['Complete committed g0-r0013-pair_joint_both backbone: embeddings, local activation, recency/relation summaries, linear position moments, relation/content banks, feedback memory, joint pair summaries, interaction and towers.','g2-r0016-diversity_factorized eight old/recent x category/brand bins, histogram diversity, strength4 shrinkage toward the same visible-user rates.','g2-r0019-content_rates content-only 8D projection, duplicated content block, raw exposure count block, 64-hidden residual, zero final output and RNG isolation.'],proposed_difference='Add a rate_summary selector with raw compatibility, smoothed, and background modes. Smoothed uses the existing g2 support/(support+4) interpolation on the separate feedback-rate block, leaving projected content unchanged. Background repeats the visible-user four rates. All modes explicitly zero empty slots; all new variants compute the same summaries before selection. No added parameters, tokens, losses, inputs or changes to the host recipe. Three standalone modules form an exposure/diversity reliability contrast plus a background-only replacement control; the committed raw-rate model is the fourth control.',predictions=['Exposure-smoothed separate rates outperform raw g2-r0019-content_rates if extreme low-support fractions are a consequential limitation, especially in predeclared low-count/repetition strata.','If diversity captures consequential redundancy, diversity_rates beats exposure_rates on validation macro AUC with changes concentrated in repeated-ad slots; unique-ad support should agree algebraically.','Local shrinkage beats background_rates if local feedback is useful beyond visible-user composition and slot occupancy. No required superiority of diversity is assumed.','All arms start with the same backbone outputs because the residual final layer is zero; all-empty histories receive exactly zero added logits; masked IDs/task-mask entries and target action cannot affect outputs.'],falsifiers=['No candidate exceeds raw incumbent 0.8315142702328122 under the fixed macro-AUC rule: no added predictive benefit established; compare both source bests separately.','Diversity fails to beat exposure, or apparent gains disappear on paired validation repetition: no support for diversity-specific transfer.','Background-only rates match local shrinkage: no evidence for local feedback reliability beyond scale/background/occupancy.','Host equivalence, masking, finite forward/backward, BF16 or parameter checks fail: execution/integrity failure, not scientific counterevidence; preserve charged receipt.','A macro gain with worse individual tasks or Logloss must be reported as a trade-off; no undeclared veto or significance claim.'],alternative_explanations=['Seed/optimization noise and validation winner selection explain the tiny observed and future gains.','A changed feature scale or effective input rank eases the residual MLP optimization without improving rate estimation.','Repeated advertisement IDs need not imply correlated feedback; diversity may shrink useful repetition.','The backbone already encodes relevant feedback and the extra readout is redundant; added capacity explains source-vs-g0 differences.','The background includes each local group, so this is deterministic smoothing under offline visibility, not independent-prior inference.','Official offline action visibility, static snapshots, vocabularies, category/brand auxiliary labels and encoded-ID collisions limit production interpretation.'],contrasts=contrasts,cost_plan=dict(estimate_ref='g2-r0019-content_rates wall549.0168464779854s/inference44.7183698117733s; g2-r0019-content_counts wall546.2296214848757s; g2-r0018 controls wall552.7-556.6s. Runtime snapshot remaining3481.03559589386s, trial cap1208.5413760878146s.',all_variants_counted=True,attribution_reserve='Three proposed arms budgeted at approximate